<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>IRC channel logs</title><style>html {
  background: #fdfdfd;
}

h1 {
  font-weight: 300;
}

h2 {
  font-weight: 200;
}

h3 {
  padding: .5em 0;
  border-top: 3px dotted #ddd;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

form {
  width: 400px;
  display: flex;
}

input {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  border-radius: .25em 0 0 .25em;
  border: 1px solid #aaa;
  border-right: 0;
  padding: 0.5em;
}

button {
  display: flex;
  border-radius: 0 .25em .25em 0;
  background-color: #007bff;
  border: 1px solid #007bff;
  padding: .5em;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: white;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: #0069d9;
  border-color: #0062cc;
}

a {
  color: #007bff;
  text-decoration: none;
}

a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

h4 {
  margin-bottom: .5em;
}

table td {
  padding: 0.75em;
}

table tr:hover {
  background: #eee;
}

.year {
  display: table;
}

.month {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-right: 1em;
}

ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.nick {
  padding-right: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: right;
  width: 13rem;
  display: table-cell;
}

.nick a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.message {
  display: table-cell;
  padding-left: 0.6rem;
  border-left: 2px solid #333;
}

.notice {
  color: #859900;
  font-style: italic;
}

.line {
  line-height: 1.8rem;
  display: table;
}

#logs {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1.5rem;
}
</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2024-11-02.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="135410"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#135410" label="[13:54:10]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">had a go at making hex0 smaller for amd64 (for now I just have GAS version) but it looks like it should go down from 292 bytes to 228  (120 for elf header and 108 for code)</span></div><div class="line" id="140055"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#140055" label="[14:00:55]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">(current attempt <a rel="nofollow" href="https://paste.debian.net/1334302/">https://paste.debian.net/1334302/</a>  in case somebody can spot any other potential savings)</span></div><div class="line" id="142423"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#142423" label="[14:24:23]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">oh, and I can make hex0 on x86 go from 190 to 182 bytes by overlapping elf header parts</span></div><div class="line" id="142546"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#142546" label="[14:25:46]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">beginning of program section header is the same as the end of preceeding part of elf header</span></div><div class="line" id="175414"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175414" label="[17:54:14]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">stikonas: do you want to give a talk in fosdem?</span></div><div class="line" id="175435"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175435" label="[17:54:35]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">probably too lazy to go there...</span></div><div class="line" id="175626"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175626" label="[17:56:26]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">oriansj: what do you think about <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/oriansj/bootstrap-seeds/pull/46">https://github.com/oriansj/bootstrap-seeds/pull/46</a> </span></div><div class="line" id="175631"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#175631" label="[17:56:31]">&lt;Foxboron&gt;</a></span><span class="message">   43</span></div><div class="line" id="175646"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175646" label="[17:56:46]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ekaitz: are you going there</span></div><div class="line" id="175656"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175656" label="[17:56:56]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">there wasn't that much happening since last year though</span></div><div class="line" id="175714"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175714" label="[17:57:14]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">well, we finished gcc on riscv64 I guess...</span></div><div class="line" id="175722"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175722" label="[17:57:22]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">stikonas: my wife is going to have a baby in february/march</span></div><div class="line" id="175723"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175723" label="[17:57:23]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">though not yet nicely scripted anywhere</span></div><div class="line" id="175725"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175725" label="[17:57:25]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">so I cannot go</span></div><div class="line" id="175729"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175729" label="[17:57:29]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">oh, congratulations</span></div><div class="line" id="175735"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175735" label="[17:57:35]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">thank you</span></div><div class="line" id="175747"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175747" label="[17:57:47]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">the organizers of the declarative and minimalistic computing devroom asked me to give a talk</span></div><div class="line" id="175801"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175801" label="[17:58:01]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">i just thought you could do it in my behalf</span></div><div class="line" id="175803"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175803" label="[17:58:03]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">:)</span></div><div class="line" id="175855"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175855" label="[17:58:55]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">i think what we did deserves the attention, so you could go and gain the attention you deserve</span></div><div class="line" id="175907"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175907" label="[17:59:07]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">i've been talking a lot about the project since the last year</span></div><div class="line" id="175917"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#175917" label="[17:59:17]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">maybe its your time to get the attention</span></div><div class="line" id="232153"><span class="nick" style="color:#6b8072"><a href="#232153" label="[23:21:53]">&lt;fossy&gt;</a></span><span class="message">congrats ekaitz!</span></div><div class="line" id="232211"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#232211" label="[23:22:11]">&lt;ekaitz&gt;</a></span><span class="message">fossy: thank you!</span></div><br /></div></body></html>